{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 7, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon thee, fair traveler, I bestow a journey of great wonder and delight! Prepare thyself for a sojourn in the land of the rising sun, Japan!\n\nEmbark on a ship, thy course set for the ancient city of Osaka. There, thou shalt find thyself in awe of the towering castles and bustling markets. Partake in the local cuisine, feasting upon savory takoyaki and slurping down a bowl of hearty ramen.\n\nOn the third day, thou shalt venture to the sacred city of Kyoto. There, thou shalt marvel at the golden pavilion and wander through the serene gardens of the Kinkaku-ji temple. Pay homage to the gods at the Fushimi Inari shrine, where thou shalt climb the crimson torii gates and bask in the beauty of the surrounding forests.\n\nContinue thy pilgrimage to Nara, the city of deer. Feed these gentle creatures and marvel at the ancient Todai-ji temple, home to the world's largest bronze Buddha.\n\nThy final destination, dear traveler, is the vibrant city of Tokyo. Explore the bustling streets of Shibuya, where thousands of souls cross the famous scramble crossing. Delve into the heart of Akihabara, the district of anime and video games, and let thy inner geek run wild. Ascend to the top of the Tokyo Skytree and gaze upon the sprawling metropolis below.\n\nAnd so, with a heavy heart, I bid thee farewell. May this journey bring thee joy, knowledge, and unforgettable memories. Farewell, and safe travels, dear traveler!", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.3254517912864685}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.020623529329895973}, {"token": "e", "logprob": -5.4510908126831055}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.08771772682666779}, {"token": "fair", "logprob": -2.295680284500122}, {"token": "travel", "logprob": -0.05674361065030098}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "I", "logprob":